WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.471 --> 00:00:14.352
Smith is missing," Roxy thought.

2
00:00:14.372 --> 00:00:16.994
"I have to get to police headquarters."

3
00:00:19.095 --> 00:00:20.176
She called to her friends.

4
00:00:20.877 --> 00:00:21.757
"Don't wait for me.

5
00:00:21.777 --> 00:00:24.279
I, um, dropped something!"

6
00:00:24.719 --> 00:00:25.520
Roxy ran off.

7
00:00:31.308 --> 00:00:33.330
The parking lot at police headquarters was empty.

8
00:00:33.350 --> 00:00:36.812
"Where are all the police cars?"

9
00:00:37.232 --> 00:00:37.853
Roxy said.

10
00:00:37.873 --> 00:00:39.914
"And where is everyone?"

11
00:00:45.118 --> 00:00:47.619
When she went inside, Roxy blinked in surprise.

12
00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:51.702
All the walls were crooked, and the floors were slanted.

13
00:00:51.722 --> 00:00:54.985
"What happened in here?"

14
00:00:55.265 --> 00:00:55.905
Roxy said.

15
00:00:55.925 --> 00:00:59.568
"It's like a fun house at an amusement park!"

16
00:01:00.924 --> 00:01:02.485
A hallway was lined with mirrors.

17
00:01:04.647 --> 00:01:06.609
One mirror made Roxy look tall and skinny.

18
00:01:07.970 --> 00:01:09.711
Another one made her head look enormous.

19
00:01:12.654 --> 00:01:14.075
Roxy made her way to the break room.

20
00:01:15.116 --> 00:01:17.598
The coffeemaker was on, and cookies sat on the counter.

21
00:01:18.298 --> 00:01:19.499
Music played on a radio.

22
00:01:21.841 --> 00:01:22.922
But nobody was there.

23
00:01:24.423 --> 00:01:25.544
Roxy scratched her head.

24
00:01:25.564 --> 00:01:27.265
"This is odd."

25
00:01:28.386 --> 00:01:31.436
Click Ba-doom!

26
00:01:31.456 --> 00:01:34.977
The floor tilted under Roxy's feet, and she slid down into darkness.

27
00:01:34.997 --> 00:01:37.918
"Oof!" Roxy landed on a hard floor.

28
00:01:37.938 --> 00:01:39.819
"Rocket Girl?"

29
00:01:40.219 --> 00:01:41.259
It was Detective Smith.

30
00:01:42.339 --> 00:01:45.540
Using her night vision, Roxy saw she was in a concrete room.

31
00:01:46.841 --> 00:01:48.041
The detective stood near her.

32
00:01:48.701 --> 00:01:50.562
Other police officers were in the room too.

33
00:01:51.782 --> 00:01:52.443
Roxy grinned.

34
00:01:52.463 --> 00:01:54.563
"Are you all playing hide-and-seek?"

35
00:01:55.584 --> 00:01:56.904
Detective Smith looked annoyed.

36
00:01:57.600 --> 00:01:59.181
"This isn't funny, Rocket Girl.

37
00:01:59.341 --> 00:02:01.482
We've been stuck down here since yesterday!"

38
00:02:02.282 --> 00:02:03.062
Roxy gulped.

39
00:02:03.082 --> 00:02:05.403
"Oh Sorry to hear that.

40
00:02:06.364 --> 00:02:07.564
What happened to the building?

41
00:02:07.904 --> 00:02:09.125
It's like a fun house."

42
00:02:10.405 --> 00:02:12.526
"We hired a builder to make some improvements."

43
00:02:13.147 --> 00:02:14.207
Detective Smith sighed.

44
00:02:14.227 --> 00:02:17.248
"Obviously he did a terrible job.

45
00:02:17.548 --> 00:02:19.189
We can't even use the building now."

46
00:02:19.209 --> 00:02:20.910
"Who is the builder?"

47
00:02:21.230 --> 00:02:21.910
Roxy asked.

48
00:02:21.930 --> 00:02:25.832
"His name is Jack Hammer," Detective Smith said.

49
00:02:26.396 --> 00:02:27.397
"We won't hire him again."

50
00:02:28.437 --> 00:02:29.998
Another police officer walked over.

51
00:02:30.018 --> 00:02:32.178
"How will we get out of here?"

52
00:02:32.459 --> 00:02:32.979
she asked.

53
00:02:34.579 --> 00:02:35.360
Roxy laughed.

54
00:02:35.960 --> 00:02:37.641
"That's easy."

55
00:02:38.361 --> 00:02:41.422
She flew the police officers up to the break room.

56
00:02:45.544 --> 00:02:47.645
Detective Smith grabbed a cookie and took a bite.

57
00:02:48.965 --> 00:02:51.426
The police dispatcher saw a light flashing on the phone.

58
00:02:51.446 --> 00:02:53.707
"Yikes!" she said.

59
00:02:53.727 --> 00:02:55.288
"We have messages."

60
00:02:55.784 --> 00:02:56.965
She played the first message.

61
00:02:56.985 --> 00:03:01.729
"Hello? I'm worried about my friends Brenda and Dan Dooley.

62
00:03:01.989 --> 00:03:03.770
They moved into their new house yesterday.

63
00:03:03.790 --> 00:03:05.491
It's at Ten Puddle Lane.

64
00:03:05.812 --> 00:03:09.034
I tried calling and knocking on their door, but there's no answer."

65
00:03:10.975 --> 00:03:12.817
Other people had called with similar messages.

66
00:03:13.978 --> 00:03:15.639
Many of them had called more than once.

67
00:03:16.720 --> 00:03:19.161
Detective Smith swallowed the last bite of his cookie.

68
00:03:21.103 --> 00:03:21.963
"Oh boy."
